            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Roseanne Billips"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was great. A tasty change from traditional popcorn or caramel corn. The only change I made was to pour the popped popcorn in a brown paper bag, then pour the hot peanut butter mixture on top, close the bag and shake it to coat the popcorn. It gets the popcorn coated evenly and is less messy."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "B Joy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Quick, easy and delicious. I made mine with fresh air popped popcorn. 2 batches 1/2 Cup kernels each yielded the perfect amount of popped corn. Also I buttered a giant stainless steel serving bowl and used a silicone mixing spoon to toss &amp; coat the popped corn worked great nothing stuck to the bowl.",
            "datePublished": "2012-12-30T06:27:33.247Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "bizylizy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a great tasting recipe, me and my friend made it. However, there was too much popcorn and not enough sauce. Next time I will be using only two bags of popcorn. Also, the biggest bowl I had, which was quite big, was too small for all the popcorn, it was very hard to mix it, and we ended up using our hands. The peanut butter mixture was too hot and we ended up burning ourselves, next time I will try the paper bag method. None the less, this was very tasty and addictive and will be made again - SOON!",
            "datePublished": "2012-08-11T14:20:19.740Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jab300"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was delicious! Did as a previous poster suggested and put the popcorn in a brown paper bag to shake the coating. Tried to leave it spread out on wax paper to dry completely, but my boys wouldn't stop eating it!",
            "datePublished": "2011-07-26T12:10:11.967Z"
          },
          {
