            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "esk"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This turned out great - we'll be eating it often around here. Perfect treat for the kids &amp; it was easy to put together. We did not use microwave popcorn, so I compensated by adding 1/2 t of salt.",
